{
  "about": [
    "The receipt poster's words (from Lance's poster_words.json, restructured 2026-09-27).",
    "rooms: keyed by the show's room ids (shows/MAD-DIM.json). Each room gives every guest the same word; a return gives nothing new.",
    "roles: which templates the word can go in (noun, verb, adj, quant); plural makes {IS} read 'are'.",
    "poster.templates: one line per saved word; two nouns visited one after the other may share a noun_pair line (pairChance). The lines are then shuffled.",
    "In a template: {W} / {W1} {W2} are room words, {IS} / {IS1} {IS2} is/are to match them, and every other {slot} is filler from the category poster.slots names.",
    "categories: filler only. Room words are left out of them, so no room's word is ever filler."
  ],
